        "The linked axis can have the opposite letter (to constrain the aspect ratio)",
        "or the same letter (to match scales across subplots).",
        "Loops (`yaxis: {scaleanchor: *x*}, xaxis: {scaleanchor: *y*}` or longer) are redundant",
